      "root_cause": "Legacy forwarded a failed login to the JSP login page (200). Migrated uses Post/Redirect/Get: 302 to /signin?error. Same outcome: no token, no cookie, back on the login form. Known limitation: the React sign-in page does not read ?error yet, so a failed legacy-style form POST shows the empty form without an error banner (the SPA's own JSON sign-in does show one).",
      "status": "INTENTIONAL DIFFERENCE"
